  displayName: Frozen traveller's journal
  description: A book-bearer's journal, frozen shut at the last page. 'Our patron
    met us at the armory and paid in old silver. He would not touch the tome, not
    even to count the pages. Said he and books had an understanding. Cold tonight.
    The tome is heavier than it looks.'
